{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Life in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Life in Korea is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since this is our first episode, let's start with introductions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll go first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My name is Didi, and I'm Korean but I use the nickname Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36000,
    "dDurationMs": 13000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I used to work as a UI and UX designer, and currently I'm running a YouTube channel called Didi's Korean Culture Podcast for foreigners interested in Korean culture and the Korean language."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nice to meet you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nice to meet you. I'm Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm someone who teaches Korean to foreign language learners through games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I run YouTube channels called Comprehensible Input Korean and All Things Korean podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67000,
    "dDurationMs": 13000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I used to do the podcast alone, but starting today I'm creating this new podcast regularly with Tae-woong as my first regular guest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much for coming as my first regular guest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not at all, don't mention it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, we're planning to talk like this every week and upload the podcast every Tuesday, but is that okay with your schedule, Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that works for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although I found out today that we're doing this every week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, we didn't just decide on the upload time today—we decided on the name just about 10 minutes ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We decided on the concept and even the introduction very hastily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, for something we put together like roasting beans over a sudden fire, it's pretty good, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129000,
    "dDurationMs": 13000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is good. Yomojomo. Oh, the name is Yomojomo of Life in Korea, and I think some people might not be familiar with the word Yomojomo, so what does Yomojomo mean, Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo? It's the diminutive form of the word \"imojomo.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, what does imojomo mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think you can understand it as a cute way of saying various kinds of appearances or aspects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159000,
    "dDurationMs": 11000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, compared to imojomo, yomojomo seems to express smaller and more detailed things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're trying to talk about small things that happen in life in Korea, various stories like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why? Because we're planning to choose one theme for each episode and talk about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I was thinking about what to make the first theme, and Tae-woong suggested today's first theme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's today's theme?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's theme is delivery culture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Delivery. Delivery culture. Why did you recommend this theme?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it's about the yomojomo of everyday life, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I just suggested it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wait a moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why did you just give a reason? The reason too was hastily put together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just came to mind? In your head?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. We were having an ideas meeting last time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you use delivery a lot, Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought I used it a lot, but it doesn't seem like I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How often do you order? If you think about it per week?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I order once or twice a week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't seem like a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what they said. I even got scolded once when I mentioned it to people around me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you eat once or twice and they said that's a lot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you usually order?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I order is actually pretty fixed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hamburgers. And I only order from one specific hamburger place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it's a handmade burger place in Busan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you eat handmade burgers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. We're going to cover the yomojomo of hamburgers in a hamburger episode next time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because there's a lot to talk about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see. If you keep ordering regularly like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yes. The owner is a man who looks very manly, and the two of us have a very touching relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You mean with Teacher Tae-woong and that boss?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To that extent? It's endearing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, do you eat there often when you go?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You eat hamburgers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you order pizza pretty often too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Can I try to guess one more thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh? Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chicken."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chicken used to be that way back then, but not these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. You don't eat it often?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't eat it that often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's a reason why that changed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. That too? Do you talk about that on Yomojomo about chicken?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. Yes. I can talk about it in the next episode. In the episode that comes out next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. On Yomojomo about chicken. So you don't eat chicken often, so what do you eat then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That hamburger. Pizza."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pizza."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like there's nothing besides that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Two things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this week hamburger. Next week pizza. The week after that hamburger. The week after that pizza. Is it that kind of feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's that kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. You must really love hamburgers and pizza. Eating them once a week like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I've really loved hamburgers since way back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few years ago, I. Oh. This is when I should talk about hamburgers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't forget that today's topic is delivery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. That's right. I should talk about it within the context of delivery, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well. It's convenient to eat, after all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. Hamburgers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ordering delivery and eating. Oh. Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But no matter how convenient delivery is, you still have to clean up after eating the delivered food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I like hamburgers a bit more because there's minimal cleanup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. Delivery is so convenient but the cleanup is annoying. Isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course. Of course it's much more convenient than cooking at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't have to do dishes or anything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't order things like malatang?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Surprisingly, I've never ordered malatang even once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you eaten it before?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have eaten it before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. Things like malatang are, in my opinion, difficult to order for delivery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The cleanup being annoying. That's number one. Soup dishes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm. And things like pig's feet too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bones and. And things like makguksu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. You always have leftovers. That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. And pickled radish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pickled radish. Do you have leftovers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't really like those kinds of things. I don't eat them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. You can just ask them to leave it out. In the special requests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Leave out the sweet pickled radish too. Leave out the pickled radish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a good point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You shouldn't throw away food. As much as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. That's a good question. A sharp observation. I agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Stuff with bones in it. Like when you order gamjatang, it's really hard to deal with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see. Do you order things like gamjatang sometimes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I don't order it myself, but when I see other people ordering it, they really struggle with dealing with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for the same reason, I order things like hamburgers or pizza."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or fried rice, rice bowls—things I can eat cleanly like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you tend to order a lot of things that are easy to eat cleanly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm similar, but I'd say I'm at the extreme end of that point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah. That's the most important thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Because I'm eating for convenience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah. So you don't order things like malatang?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But suddenly malatang is a food I really want to eat. Things like malatang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why do you like malatang so much?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I actually really liked malatang, but recently I've gotten tired of it, I guess? From eating it so much?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many years did it take for you to get tired of it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600000,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Malatang was pretty popular from way back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604640,
    "dDurationMs": 10440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. From what I remember, it became popular around 2016."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615080,
    "dDurationMs": 5639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I didn't know, but I found out I like shabu-shabu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620719,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can choose the ingredients you want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625200,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like... um... how do I put it? Why is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630280,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't like things like soup rice, but I like shabu-shabu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634080,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636080,
    "dDurationMs": 679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636759,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're definitely different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638680,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Both have ingredients in hot broth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644880,
    "dDurationMs": 5879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but what I like best is that I can choose what I want to eat, what I want to eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650759,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653160,
    "dDurationMs": 2479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are there other dishes like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655639,
    "dDurationMs": 1521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Besides shabu-shabu?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657160,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658000,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Choosing ingredients. Um... there's no other dish,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662759,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when you go to a buffet, you can eat only what you want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665599,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667599,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm kind of a picky eater."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670160,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672120,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673080,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673720,
    "dDurationMs": 3839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you have shabu-shabu, do you only put meat in it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677559,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh... no. There are some vegetables I don't eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680639,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah... I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682559,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So only the vegetables I like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685279,
    "dDurationMs": 881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686160,
    "dDurationMs": 2799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with things like soup rice, it just comes out as is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688959,
    "dDurationMs": 841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since I was little, if I didn't eat something I disliked, I'd get scolded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693800,
    "dDurationMs": 5159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and because of those experiences, that feeling of eating only what I want?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698959,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699559,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like the feeling of eating without guilt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701800,
    "dDurationMs": 2719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704519,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah... so it was because of picky eating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707239,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Yes, yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708959,
    "dDurationMs": 3481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Picky eating is one reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712440,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715160,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716400,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717400,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also order malatang for delivery sometimes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720680,
    "dDurationMs": 519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721199,
    "dDurationMs": 2841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724040,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726559,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are there foods you think you just can't order for delivery?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why? For what reason?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733279,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, for whatever reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734919,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Foods you can't order for delivery?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736880,
    "dDurationMs": 799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737679,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there something you've never ordered for delivery?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742839,
    "dDurationMs": 1521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744360,
    "dDurationMs": 6479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, not just recently but from quite a long time ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750839,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things like pork belly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752759,
    "dDurationMs": 1321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754080,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can order for delivery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755279,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756559,
    "dDurationMs": 4521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I just thought I couldn't order that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761080,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I agree. Me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763240,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because that needs to be grilled and eaten right away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764839,
    "dDurationMs": 1521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. That's right. That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766360,
    "dDurationMs": 2559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, it's things like grilled intestines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768919,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you've never ordered that for delivery either?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771199,
    "dDurationMs": 1321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. Me neither."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772520,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775600,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things that taste good when grilled on a grill plate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778440,
    "dDurationMs": 399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778839,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. I don't think people order those."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780279,
    "dDurationMs": 4521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pork belly, intestines, lamb skewers, things like that too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784800,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you even order lamb skewers for delivery?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787880,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. You can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788520,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They take all the skewers out and just give you the lamb meat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791800,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My older brother orders it sometimes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793639,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794559,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796320,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's nothing that can't be done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797720,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the price would be about the same as eating it there, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800600,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802520,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, the aesthetics of lamb skewers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806320,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lie in that performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809360,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, the whole process?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811240,
    "dDurationMs": 879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812119,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I get it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814600,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. And like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818720,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not a food you eat alone, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820919,
    "dDurationMs": 881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821800,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So whether it's two people or several people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824880,
    "dDurationMs": 2679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sitting in a circle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827559,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like grilling meat in some primitive era"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832919,
    "dDurationMs": 1161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834080,
    "dDurationMs": 3559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching it on the charcoal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837639,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838839,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spinning around, it warms your heart, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842720,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844520,
    "dDurationMs": 3039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if that's not there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847559,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849800,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, my understanding of a menu more confusing than pork belly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852919,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been updated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855039,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lamb skewers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857440,
    "dDurationMs": 1359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, now that you mention it, that's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858799,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did eat lamb skewers pretty joyfully"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862359,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'd never thought about the aesthetics like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867119,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, this process makes it taste even better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870799,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I never thought that before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872239,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but now that you mention it, that's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873399,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't you think so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874679,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877480,
    "dDurationMs": 4039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lamb skewers, I also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881519,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I mentioned lamb skewers, it came to mind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884079,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884839,
    "dDurationMs": 1201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, do I need to make a separate episode about lamb skewers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886040,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You should talk about it on Yomojomo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888799,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind is it? Is that okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890359,
    "dDurationMs": 1121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I'll try it soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891480,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893600,
    "dDurationMs": 4919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a close friend, and a close friend who lives in Seoul,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898519,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, by the way, I live in Busan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900399,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901239,
    "dDurationMs": 961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902200,
    "dDurationMs": 3319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One time at the end of the year, in winter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905519,
    "dDurationMs": 2201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to go up to Seoul,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907720,
    "dDurationMs": 3519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I met that friend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911239,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and went to a lamb skewer restaurant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915839,
    "dDurationMs": 641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916480,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at that lamb restaurant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919959,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should I call it a signature menu?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921679,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have that kind of menu,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923079,
    "dDurationMs": 7361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they skewer a whole lamb leg on a large skewer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930440,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932040,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and grill it while rotating it for a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935320,
    "dDurationMs": 2239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One lamb leg comes out per table?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937559,
    "dDurationMs": 2161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a photo of it too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941880,
    "dDurationMs": 2639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the leg is really, really big."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944519,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946079,
    "dDurationMs": 1681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it's not like super huge or anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947760,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's about the size of my arm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949959,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952079,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the way you eat it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954239,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is you stick it on this really big skewer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956760,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's like one giant lamb skewer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960320,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961760,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You rotate it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963920,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and chat with your friend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966440,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and slowly cut off little pieces with a knife to eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971440,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does it taste?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972440,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it's delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974279,
    "dDurationMs": 3201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The visual is kind of like that feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977480,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kind of like One Piece meat, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it's similar, it's similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980000,
    "dDurationMs": 679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's similar?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980679,
    "dDurationMs": 321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981000,
    "dDurationMs": 3279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like primitive man meat from a cartoon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984279,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985320,
    "dDurationMs": 2039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987359,
    "dDurationMs": 641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tell me about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988000,
    "dDurationMs": 2079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it a restaurant you recommend?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990079,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I really recommend it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992279,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992959,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it's a restaurant in Daerim-dong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996320,
    "dDurationMs": 1079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997399,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Daerim-dong Joma Lamb Leg Grilled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000519,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Joma."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001399,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002519,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it Chinese?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003519,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004119,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Joma lamb leg grilled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005160,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lamb leg grilled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006640,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008079,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Joma lamb leg grilled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009839,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010959,
    "dDurationMs": 1641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012600,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you go in summer, it'll probably be difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014880,
    "dDurationMs": 799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015679,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the fire is too hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017119,
    "dDurationMs": 1521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fire is hot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018640,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019880,
    "dDurationMs": 2399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You should go in winter for it to be just right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022679,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Winter is almost over, so I should go soon, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026119,
    "dDurationMs": 1201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027320,
    "dDurationMs": 1239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it would be expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028559,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think it was that expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030559,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031600,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033200,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please send me pictures too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035040,
    "dDurationMs": 1519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, I'll send them to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036559,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, after this is done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038040,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038880,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040200,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why did this topic come up anyway?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042600,
    "dDurationMs": 1639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh well, anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044239,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045519,
    "dDurationMs": 3681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat that meat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049200,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single piece you eat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052000,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from that big leg,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053679,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you slice it up and eat it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055640,
    "dDurationMs": 719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056359,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a kind of performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058519,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059920,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But so much time passed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062839,
    "dDurationMs": 921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063760,
    "dDurationMs": 2639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that a staff member came"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066399,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and just removed that whole leg"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069239,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since it was cooked through,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071519,
    "dDurationMs": 2921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they disassembled all the meat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074440,
    "dDurationMs": 3239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and cut it up nicely for us to eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077679,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078679,
    "dDurationMs": 2201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But after that happened,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080880,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my stomach suddenly got very full,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082679,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085399,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that performance disappeared, didn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087519,
    "dDurationMs": 1081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088600,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now all that's left is just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090000,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meat that you can pick up with chopsticks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092760,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093640,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe that's why,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096920,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that could be it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098480,
    "dDurationMs": 3079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, of course that's like the chicken or egg question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101559,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102239,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but my stomach was full too at that point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104160,
    "dDurationMs": 1519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105679,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107399,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was no emotional impact from that performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109640,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110720,
    "dDurationMs": 3959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more of that performance there is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114679,
    "dDurationMs": 321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ordering delivery would be a bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117400,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "disappointing, wouldn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118440,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120000,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120440,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are things like that, you know, like sashimi tuna"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122440,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they slice it right in front of you and such"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124640,
    "dDurationMs": 1719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eating while watching that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126359,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "versus ordering it at home and eating it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128159,
    "dDurationMs": 400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128559,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be different, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129359,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130840,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think food culture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134640,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is limited to just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137320,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what goes into your mouth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139119,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141679,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So people pay attention to the interior design"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144200,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145080,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the experience, don't you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147840,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149320,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really relate to that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150880,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the places I consider"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153400,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be good restaurants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155239,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aren't just about the food being delicious—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157719,
    "dDurationMs": 2361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I realized this recently—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160080,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the restaurant has to be clean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162599,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for me to feel like it's a good restaurant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164919,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165960,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The eating experience itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167919,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "needs to have a sense of cleanliness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171440,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the whole thing to become"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175000,
    "dDurationMs": 1159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a good memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176159,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1177599,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179559,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From that perspective,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181359,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "delivery could be a plus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183280,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it could be a minus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184599,
    "dDurationMs": 361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184960,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Delivery is really for when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187440,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188000,
    "dDurationMs": 1159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're too lazy to go out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189159,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189719,
    "dDurationMs": 281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190000,
    "dDurationMs": 3159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so do you usually cook at home?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193200,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194520,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cook fairly often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196080,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197119,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the menu—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197719,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting from rice?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198960,
    "dDurationMs": 719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199679,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rice?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200000,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting from cooking the rice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201760,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yeah, I cook rice often"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203160,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204960,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't eat instant rice?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207240,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208560,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, well, I don't really eat instant rice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210400,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Almost never, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212200,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212760,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214160,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should I call it a cultural difference?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217040,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, what kind of cultural difference?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219040,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong's culture and my culture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221680,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, I mean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223120,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my household itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1225400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting from my mother"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227400,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't really eat instant rice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230080,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we always keep rice in the rice cooker, so that's how we do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233840,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234720,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So because I got used to not eating instant rice, I just don't eat it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238400,
    "dDurationMs": 719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239119,
    "dDurationMs": 1361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just naturally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240480,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, are you living alone right now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242400,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, I'm living with my mother right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1245000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246000,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you must have a lot of cooking equipment and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248680,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1249840,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251240,
    "dDurationMs": 3519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even when I lived alone, I didn't eat instant rice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1254759,
    "dDurationMs": 1081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255840,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always cooked rice in the rice cooker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258040,
    "dDurationMs": 1879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259919,
    "dDurationMs": 2601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, so that's why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262520,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like soup rice or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263880,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264320,
    "dDurationMs": 3279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, rice that comes with the meal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267599,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I order delivery food, I ask them to leave out the rice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270760,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272400,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since I always have rice at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274080,
    "dDurationMs": 2559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the rice that comes with delivery doesn't taste good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276639,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, it gets a bit hard, doesn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278120,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1279360,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you ask them not to include rice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281879,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282959,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the price the same? Or does it get cheaper?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286120,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The price is the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287400,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288400,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doesn't it feel wasteful somehow?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289440,
    "dDurationMs": 1759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291199,
    "dDurationMs": 2161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you request delivery, you write a message, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293360,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294360,
    "dDurationMs": 1239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like \"please leave this out\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295599,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or \"please do it this way\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296639,
    "dDurationMs": 1721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or \"please remove this ingredient\" and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298360,
    "dDurationMs": 2599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, you can write in the request section."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300959,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so you can make requests through messages like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303879,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at that time I'm a bit more straightforward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306360,
    "dDurationMs": 519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306879,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like \"you don't need to include rice or whatever,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1309360,
    "dDurationMs": 1519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but please make it delicious, hehe.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310879,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, keke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312199,
    "dDurationMs": 481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312680,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314480,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hehe keke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316320,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317080,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you do it that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318160,
    "dDurationMs": 759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318919,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of the time they gave us service instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322879,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like beverages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324720,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or beverages?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326000,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, beverages or side menu items like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329720,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330440,
    "dDurationMs": 2319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1332759,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mentioned earlier that they only deliver hamburgers and pizza."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336399,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337279,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After half a year, kimchi stew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339600,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340080,
    "dDurationMs": 2559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I ordered it for delivery last Saturday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342639,
    "dDurationMs": 681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343320,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They did the same thing then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344800,
    "dDurationMs": 599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345399,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they gave me steamed egg as a complimentary service."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349279,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have been so happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350679,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I really enjoyed it deliciously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353199,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, did you leave a review?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355199,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, because I am a man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356759,
    "dDurationMs": 1121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357880,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're a man, you should leave a review."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1361759,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because a man doesn't look back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364559,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you don't write reviews?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365479,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, then you never participate in review events or anything like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369039,
    "dDurationMs": 1121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1370160,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, review events."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371800,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't like them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373000,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1374919,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like deceiving people?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376559,
    "dDurationMs": 801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377360,
    "dDurationMs": 2479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379839,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That review event."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382160,
    "dDurationMs": 599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382759,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, like you order delivery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384639,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385279,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you write us a good review, we'll give you a service."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389039,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That kind of event."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391440,
    "dDurationMs": 839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392279,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You say you'll participate in the event."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394199,
    "dDurationMs": 1321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395520,
    "dDurationMs": 4039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you write a good review like that, there's that kind of culture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399559,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400800,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't like it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402639,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406479,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just feels like there's a sense of resistance, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409919,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a rigged game of Go-Stop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412000,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, yes, that's."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414960,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't really know how review events started in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418960,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421600,
    "dDurationMs": 1519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423119,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424160,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426000,
    "dDurationMs": 5119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just by writing a review."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431119,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They give you service."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433759,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436000,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would accept it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438080,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, accept it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439720,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's just about whether you write a review or not, and you only do it if you write."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444320,
    "dDurationMs": 799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445119,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can write honest reviews, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448279,
    "dDurationMs": 1081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449360,
    "dDurationMs": 4319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But guys like me don't write reviews very often,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453679,
    "dDurationMs": 3761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so to encourage that a bit, everyone does it like this—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457440,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they give rewards for products or something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461000,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I understand that part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464760,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465440,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When there are more reviews,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467760,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the point of reviews is that when there are more reviews,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471160,
    "dDurationMs": 3919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uh, other people can understand this restaurant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475079,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this establishment better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1478359,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they become clues, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1480279,
    "dDurationMs": 1361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481640,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482679,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In that sense it's good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485720,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if people are writing good reviews in exchange for compensation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491160,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492359,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if the reviews are great and the scores are high,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1495959,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496799,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you don't know if it's actually delicious and good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498559,
    "dDurationMs": 3441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if it's good because a lot of people wanted to get the service."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502000,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, there is that downside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504440,
    "dDurationMs": 1239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505679,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with reviews too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1507480,
    "dDurationMs": 4039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now you shouldn't just look at the score—you have to read the reviews carefully."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511519,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because there are people who participated because of the event."
