    "tStartMs": 2718000,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soy sauce egg rice fixed? Yes, it's fixed. Fixed. Almost every day. Huh? Really? You don't get tired of eating it like that?"
