  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2725040,
    "dDurationMs": 10560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I have a tip. Yes. If you wrap soy sauce egg rice in seaweed, you can prevent getting tired of it a bit. Yes."
