  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2775239,
    "dDurationMs": 12201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even hangover relief is possible. Of course. Oh, that's it, right? Fry an egg and just put it on rice, add soy sauce and sesame oil and mix it? That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2787440,
    "dDurationMs": 14200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. But since I eat it so often, to bring out the maximum flavor, Chef Baek Jong-won posted on YouTube how to make soy sauce egg rice delicious."
