    "tStartMs": 2926039,
    "dDurationMs": 9680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the end. Exactly. It can't help but be delicious. It's really the best. I get happy in the morning. Then you'll be looking forward to tomorrow morning. Of course."
